WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:31.958
In the previous verse, we learned

2
00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:34.625
that for one who has conquered the mind,

3
00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:36.541
the mind is their friend.

4
00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.875
Now in the next three verses,

5
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.666
Lord Krishna is explaining the
qualities and characteristics

6
00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:43.666
of such a person.

7
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.416
Lord Krishna says in this verse

8
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.125
that a person who conquers the mind

9
00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:57.958
has realized God within themselves,

10
00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:01.083
has found Him. And such a person

11
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:05.583
cold and heat, pleasure and pain, 
honor and dishonor,

12
00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:08.750
has risen above all dualities –

13
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.208
None of these affect them.

14
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.541
This is the first time in the Bhagavad Gita

15
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:19.291
that Lord Krishna is 
clearly using the word 'Paramātmā.'

16
00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:25.291
Yes, you may have heard this word in 
the explanation of previous verses. 

17
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.958
or the mention of 'Supreme Truth'

18
00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:32.708
But Lord Krishna himself is using
this word for the first time.

19
00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:36.750
This word Paramātmā will certainly
 come again in coming chapters,

20
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:40.041
when Lord Krishna will shed light 
on the nature of this subject

21
00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:42.500
and will explain that this same Paramātmā,

22
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.291
residing within a person,

23
00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:46.666
is also the observer of all their actions, 

24
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:51.875
the witness, and is the one who grants 
permission to perform those actions.

25
00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:56.125
Paramātmā resides in all beings
 and humans, but the mind

26
00:01:56.125 --> 00:02:00.000
misleads the being in the cravings
 of the material world,

27
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
pulls a person away from this Paramātmā.

28
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.375
To such an extent that in this deception 
of the mind, a person even forgets to experience

29
00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:10.166
the presence of Paramātmā.

30
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.708
But one who has controlled the mind

31
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:14.958
doesn't fall into these deceptions.

32
00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:18.958
The noise of worldly cravings in 
their mind starts to quiet down,

33
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:20.833
and in this very peace and concentration,

34
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:24.916
a person begins to experience
the presence of Paramātmā.

35
00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:28.708
And one who has known that 
Paramātmā is within them,

36
00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:33.666
such a person will not be disturbed by 
any circumstance in the world.

37
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:35.625
This is that supreme state

38
00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:38.875
where a person attains the state of samadhi.

39
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:42.000
Samadhi means focusing
 the mind on Paramātmā

40
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.041
with complete concentration.

41
00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:47.750
And after attaining this state,

42
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.416
external circumstances cannot

43
00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:52.250
affect a person.

44
00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:57.833
If your

45
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.958
mind is not controlled,

46
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:03.916
you will be disturbed again and again.

47
00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:07.541
An uncontrolled mind will 
continuously keep you entangled

48
00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:11.041
in the dualities of honor and dishonor,

49
00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:15.125
pleasure and pain, profit and loss.

50
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.250
And this will break your peace

51
00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.083
and concentration.

52
00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:23.833
But if you bring the mind under control,

53
00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:29.250
you will rise above all these dualities.

54
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.833
Think –

55
00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:33.166
in the world there are countless people,

56
00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:34.791
countless circumstances,

57
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:38.250
countless perspectives.

58
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.291
Is it possible

59
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:44.500
that one thing is appropriate for everyone,

60
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.125
praiseworthy for everyone?

61
00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:49.833
No, right?

62
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:52.291
For example,

63
00:03:52.291 --> 00:03:53.791
an unruly student

64
00:03:53.791 --> 00:03:56.875
needs discipline,

65
00:03:56.875 --> 00:04:02.000
whereas a disciplined student
 needs encouragement.

66
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.166
For the good of students,

67
00:04:04.166 --> 00:04:07.916
a good teacher will be strict sometimes,

68
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:10.541
gentle sometimes.

69
00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:13.833
Now in such a case, someone will criticize them,

70
00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:16.166
someone will praise them.

71
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:18.791
But if that teacher

72
00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:20.625
starts getting affected

73
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:24.791
by all these reactions, they will become confused

74
00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:29.791
about their very purpose of teaching 
students the right lessons.

75
00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:32.125
What's important here is

76
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:38.041
that the teacher's purpose
 be both pure and clean.

77
00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:41.166
In such a case, neither praise nor criticism

78
00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:44.333
can disturb them.

79
00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:45.708
Similarly,

80
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:48.333
if your purpose is pure

81
00:04:48.333 --> 00:04:50.250
and your mind is controlled,

82
00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.958
the world's reactions

83
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:55.583
cannot affect you.

84
00:04:55.583 --> 00:04:57.291
Remember,

85
00:04:57.291 --> 00:05:00.541
peace doesn't come from external circumstances,

86
00:05:00.541 --> 00:05:05.000
but from your internal thinking.

87
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.416
When the mind is calm,

88
00:05:07.416 --> 00:05:11.000
you can remain stable in every circumstance.

89
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:15.625
And when external circumstances
 don't disturb your attention,

90
00:05:15.625 --> 00:05:19.708
you can look within instead of outside,

91
00:05:19.708 --> 00:05:24.541
where the presence of Paramātmā is.

92
00:05:24.541 --> 00:05:30.000
And one who has experienced 
this presence of Paramātmā,

93
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.666
for them pleasure and pain are the same.

94
00:05:35.666 --> 00:05:38.875
This very balance and steadiness

95
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:43.583
is the key to your spiritual upliftment.

96
00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:50.166
The bigger the family,

97
00:05:50.166 --> 00:05:54.208
the more diversity you'll find in it.

98
00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:56.541
Everyone has their own experiences

99
00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:59.916
and perspectives.

100
00:05:59.916 --> 00:06:03.083
If in such a situation,

101
00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:06.708
all family members start expecting

102
00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:10.083
that everyone else should 
agree with their perspective,

103
00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:13.583
everyone should act according to them,

104
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:18.583
then think about what will happen?

105
00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:22.750
There will be conflict on every
 matter, discord will increase.

106
00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.916
No one will be happy,

107
00:06:24.916 --> 00:06:27.833
because everyone's happiness

108
00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:31.166
depends on others' reactions.

109
00:06:31.166 --> 00:06:33.750
But on the other hand, if every member

110
00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:37.250
of that family tries to control their mind

111
00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:41.625
and follow spiritual principles,

112
00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:45.125
the atmosphere of the home will change.

113
00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:49.916
Ego, disputes, and differences 
will start to decrease.

114
00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:53.625
Because everyone is peaceful within.

115
00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:57.875
Everyone knows that the 
definition of right and wrong

116
00:06:57.875 --> 00:07:01.000
can change according to circumstances.

117
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.666
And if this is so, then what's 
there to disagree about?

118
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:07.166
Yes, discussion can

119
00:07:07.166 --> 00:07:09.291
certainly happen to reach

120
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:12.250
the right decision, but

121
00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.750
now the purpose of this discussion is not

122
00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.166
who will be proven right.

123
00:07:17.166 --> 00:07:19.916
Rather, the purpose of discussion will be

124
00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:22.875
what is the right decision to make.

125
00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:24.583
Here the focal point is

126
00:07:24.583 --> 00:07:26.791
not personal ego,

127
00:07:26.791 --> 00:07:29.041
but each other's welfare.

128
00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:32.291
And such a family will then not be disturbed

129
00:07:32.291 --> 00:07:36.208
by anyone's comments in society either.

130
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:38.375
And yes, remember,

131
00:07:38.375 --> 00:07:40.916
true love flourishes only

132
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:45.083
where there is such peace, 
where there is mutual harmony.

133
00:07:45.083 --> 00:07:46.583
However,

134
00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:50.458
the beginning of all this won't
 come from anywhere else,

135
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.250
but from you.

136
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.000
So first of all,

137
00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:57.166
you start seeking inner peace,

138
00:07:57.166 --> 00:07:58.416
and then

139
00:07:58.416 --> 00:08:02.250
inspire your family with this.

140
00:08:06.583 --> 00:08:08.458
In professional life,

141
00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:11.916
before any external success,

142
00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:13.291
it is essential

143
00:08:13.291 --> 00:08:16.083
that you conquer your mind

144
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:18.416
and achieve internal success.

145
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:20.333
It's natural for the workplace environment

146
00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:22.250
to be complex.

147
00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.458
Because here there are different types of people,

148
00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:27.583
everyone has different purposes,

149
00:08:27.583 --> 00:08:29.208
different perspectives,

150
00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:29.833
but

151
00:08:29.833 --> 00:08:33.333
still everyone has to work together.

152
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:37.583
There may be excessive 
competition somewhere,

153
00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:40.708
or the work burden may be too much.

154
00:08:40.708 --> 00:08:42.458
Where so many factors

155
00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:45.083
are beyond your control,

156
00:08:45.083 --> 00:08:48.125
if you start getting affected by every adverse factor,

157
00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:50.583
then instead of simplifying

158
00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:52.250
your professional life,

159
00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.791
this will complicate it further.

160
00:08:55.791 --> 00:08:58.166
But if the mind remains calm

161
00:08:58.166 --> 00:09:01.750
and controlled, you will remain safe,

162
00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:06.041
you will remain balanced and
 stable in any environment.

163
00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:09.791
As is the mind, so is the life.

164
00:09:09.791 --> 00:09:12.291
Think about this.```
